      "side": 1,
      "message": "Okay now that I\u0027ve seen the followup patches I understand this is really about \"default network\" activity. You\u0027re going to track all activities, but `isDefaultNetworkActive()` will return whether the default network is active, and not whether any network is active like I was thinking.\n\nSo now that I\u0027ve seen where you\u0027re going I think this is fine. Or more exactly, I think at this patch the code is very confusing, but when you\u0027re done it all makes sense, so let\u0027s just sumbit this patch together with the followups – my only request is that there is no time where this patch is what ToT looks like.",
